§ 3719.4. Renewal of Contract Operator Registration (a) At least 60 days before the expiration of a contract operator registration, the Office of Operator Certification shall send a written notification of the expiration date to the contract operator. Failure to receive a notice of the expiration date does not relieve the contract operator from the responsibility of renewing a registration on or before the expiration date.
