G.8.0 Other Factors as Justice may Require
In addition to the factors that are discussed above, the State Water Board shall consider any other factors as justice may require when determining the enforcement priority of a violation. For example, the State Water Board shall consider Environmental Justice concerns when determining if a violation is an enforcement priority.

