d. The completion date of the CP is specified by an enforcement order (a CDO,CAO, TSO, or ACL Order) adopted at or before the adoption of an administrative civil liability order imposing the MMPs; and, e. The deadline for completion of the CP is within 5 years of the date of the assessment of the MMP;
4. CPs may be comprised of various components, including:
a. Constructing new facilities;
b. Upgrading or repairing existing facilities;
c. Conducting water quality investigations or monitoring;
